WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:16.062
Dr. Dolittle: Now this isn’t going to hurt at all, Morris.

2
00:00:16.063 --> 00:00:19.814
Dr. Dolittle: Oh, hello! I’m Dr. Dolittle.

3
00:00:19.815 --> 00:00:22.251
It’s nice to meet you.

4
00:00:22.252 --> 00:00:25.469
Jip: I’m Jip, Dr. Dolittle’s dog.

5
00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:33.341
Jip: Did you know he can actually TALK to animals? He's AMAZING!

6
00:00:33.342 --> 00:00:36.338
Dr. Dolittle: Oh, no, not amazing at all.

7
00:00:36.339 --> 00:00:45.074
Dr. Dolittle: I learned the animal language from my friends.

8
00:00:45.075 --> 00:00:52.969
Gub-Gub: Dr. Dolittle! Dr. Dolittle! The mice refuse to eat their rice!

9
00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:56.622
Gub-Gub: Oh! I made a rhyme!

10
00:00:56.623 --> 00:01:05.643
Gub-Gub: The mice refuse the rice! The mice refuse the rice!

11
00:01:05.644 --> 00:01:07.143
Dr. Dolittle: This is Gub-Gub.

12
00:01:07.144 --> 00:01:10.578
Dr. Dolittle: He talks a lot, but he has a good heart.

13
00:01:10.579 --> 00:01:14.310
Don’t you, Gub-Gub?

14
00:01:14.311 --> 00:01:16.965
Dab-Dab: Oh, Hello! I’m Dab-Dab.

15
00:01:16.966 --> 00:01:25.162
Dab-Dab: As you can see I’m a duck, but I can swim faster [n3@than most dolphins or fish!

16
00:01:25.163 --> 00:01:29.562
Dr. Dolittle: Come in!

17
00:01:29.563 --> 00:01:31.674
Too-Too: I checked on your money, Doctor.

18
00:01:31.675 --> 00:01:36.551
Too-Too: You are spending too much money on . . . Oh, hello!

19
00:01:36.552 --> 00:01:40.296
Dr. Dolittle: Too-Too is the smartest of all my animal friends.

20
00:01:40.297 --> 00:01:46.060
Dr. Dolittle: He is great at math and has a very good ear.

21
00:01:46.061 --> 00:01:49.160
Too-Too: Did you tell them about Polynesia and Chee-Chee?

22
00:01:49.161 --> 00:01:51.612
Dab-Dab: Or how about the Pushmi-Pullyu?

23
00:01:51.613 --> 00:01:56.169
Morris: The what? I have never heard of that!

24
00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:58.217
Dr. Dolittle: Would you like to hear my story?

25
00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:01.541
Dr. Dolittle: About how I came to understand the animal language?

26
00:02:01.542 --> 00:02:03.533
Dr. Dolittle: About our journey to Africa?

27
00:02:03.534 --> 00:02:06.100
About how we escaped from pirates?

28
00:02:06.101 --> 00:02:12.066
Gub-Gub: Yeah! Let’s get some popcorn and soda!

29
00:02:12.067 --> 00:02:16.758
Dr. Dolittle: Well, I’m sorry, but I will have to begin the story next week.

30
00:02:16.759 --> 00:02:23.948
Dr. Dolittle: Today I must give Morris this shot.

31
00:02:23.949 --> 00:02:29.194
Morris:OOOOOUUUUUUUUUCCCHHH!!!!

32
00:02:29.195 --> 00:02:30.688
Squeak-Squeak: I’m Squeak-Squeak.

33
00:02:30.689 --> 00:02:40.921
Squeak-Squeak: Join us every week for the fun and exciting [n3@stories of Dr. Dolittle.
